{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a two-column section to sit directly above the contact form on the Contact page.
    
    LEFT COLUMN (plain text, no background):
    - Bold uppercase heading: "HELP WITH A WEBSITE ORDER"
    - Body text: "This form is for orders placed on created.co: order status, damaged or missing items, returns, and warranty claims (including lids and parts). Our support team will reply by email."
    
    RIGHT COLUMN (highlighted box):
    - Background color #FAF1E9 (soft cream), square corners, no border, about 28px padding
    - Bold uppercase heading: "LOOKING FOR CUSTOM DRINKWARE?"
    - Body text: "Please don't use the form below for custom inquiries. Start on our Custom page instead so your request goes straight to our custom team."
    - Button: "START A CUSTOM INQUIRY →" linking to /pages/custom. Solid black background, white uppercase text with slight letter spacing, square corners, about 14px x 22px padding. Hover background #445958.
    
    STYLE AND LAYOUT:
    - Use the theme's existing body font. Body text 18px with 27px line height, black text, white page background.
    - Columns are equal width with about 64px between them, top-aligned.
    - A thin 1px black line under the whole section, with about 32px of space above the line and 40px below it.
    - Match the page's existing side margins so it lines up with the "CONTACT US" heading and the form.
    - On mobile, stack the columns: the order text first, then the cream box, with the button full width.
    - Make all text and the button link editable in the theme editor.Create a two-column section to sit directly above the contact form on the Contact page.
    
